Refused: a default that recurses without end. Node.next is a Node whose
default is {}, so rendering it renders Node.next's default again; the
generator overflowed its stack on it
(0049-MADR-remediate-the-2026-11-01-debugging-pass.md, G2).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "Node": {"type": "object", "properties": {"next": {"allOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/Node"}], "default": {}}}},
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
-- want.err --
Node.next
the default recurses through Node.next
